          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Thanks for looking into this.\n\nSome of the other wmem code is also marked with G_GNUC_MALLOC and has null pointer checks, e.g. wmem_map. It might make sense to go through and see if any of those need removing as well (and if there's sufficient test coverage) before dropping `-fno-delete-null-pointer-checks`?",
